  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To use this template, copy the following code and fill in the appropriate fields.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Syntax\">Syntax</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>{{infobox item\n | title         = \n | image         = [e.g. \"Example.jpg\"]\n | imagewidth    = [e.g. \"150\"] [default: 210 pixels]\n | imagecaption  = \n | type          = \n | effects       = \n | source        = \n | buy           = \n | sell          = \n}}\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Samples\">Samples</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>{{infobox item\n | title         = Power Flower\n | image         = Example.jpg\n | type          = Food\n | effects       = +1 Fire\n | source        = Vendor\n | buy           = 5g\n | sell          = 1g\n}}\n</pre>\n<p>Results in...\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikia-infobox\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"wikia-infobox-header\" colspan=\"2\">Power Flower\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wikia-infobox-image\" colspan=\"2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ucp-internal-test-starter-commons/images/a/a9/Example.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200817123015\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Example\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ucp-internal-test-starter-commons/images/a/a9/Example.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200817123015\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Example.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Example.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><div class=\"wikia-infobox-section-header\">Vital statistics</div>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Type\n</th>\n<td>Food\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Effects\n</th>\n<td>+1 Fire\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Source\n</th>\n<td>Vendor\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Cost to buy\n</th>\n<td>5g\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Cost to sell\n</th>\n<td>1g\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size:0; line-height:0;\">\n<th style=\"width:50%; padding:0\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:50%; padding:0\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205358\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 51/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 562/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 55/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 478/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    3.392      1 Template:Infobox_item\n100.00%    3.392      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:65-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205358 and revision id 65. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
